        },
        {
          "text": "Manase fe Yuda pi ’ba ovupi Yerusalemua ’diyi be dria ma eza e’yo, ’dini yi ’ye onzi aga suru ndra Yehovani dri jale anzi Israelini ma drilia ’diyini ’yeleri ra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
